# PowerCoach Studio — Project Overview

Multi-platform **Flutter/Dart** app (Android, iOS, web, Windows, macOS) for gym coaches. Coaches manage clients, assign workout plans, track measurements, and view schedules.

## Stack

| Concern | Technology |
|---------|-----------|
| Language | Dart (SDK ^3.9.2), Flutter |
| Auth | Supabase (`supabase_flutter ^2.5.0`) — session (JWT) |
| Cloud SoT | Supabase `public.coach_entities` (JSONB + RLS); anon key + user JWT only |
| Local DB | **Drift** + SQLite cache (`powercoach_offline.sqlite`) |
| Local prefs | **SharedPreferences** (settings, drafts, pins, calendar reminder prefs, PDF brand) |
| External API | Coach entity CRUD via Supabase PostgREST; optional Stripe billing on web |
| Routing | `go_router ^17` — routes in `lib/core/routing/app_routes.dart`, shell in `lib/app.dart` |
| Monitoring | `sentry_flutter` (opt-in via `SENTRY_DSN`, release builds) |
| i18n | Flutter ARB — primary locale **Italian (`it`)**, secondary English |
| Theme | Material 3, dark mode default — `StitchM3Theme` in `lib/core/theme/stitch_m3_theme.dart` |

## Key Entry Points

- `lib/main.dart` — bootstrap: dotenv → Supabase auth → locale → notifications → `runApp`
- `lib/app.dart` — `MaterialApp.router` shell
- `lib/core/routing/app_routes.dart` — GoRouter route tree
- `lib/core/storage/offline_local_store.dart` — local entity reads/writes (Drift)
- `lib/core/routing/route_redirect.dart` — auth guard for protected routes

## Feature Modules (`lib/features/`)

`auth` · `landing` · `dashboard` · `customers` · `workouts` · `exercise_library` · `settings`

Each feature follows: `presentation/screens/` + optionally `data/` and `domain/`.

## Environment Variables (`.env.example` asset)

Bundled as a Flutter asset via `loadAppEnv()` in `lib/core/platform/app_env_loader.dart`.

`SUPABASE_URL` / `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — Supabase auth credentials  
`SENTRY_DSN` — optional Sentry DSN  
`SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT` — optional Sentry environment tag

Local secrets: keep them in gitignored `.env`, then run `bash scripts/ensure-env.sh` to sync into `.env.example` before `flutter run`.

## Data model (cloud SoT + Drift cache)

Coach/client/workout entities are stored in Supabase `coach_entities` (RLS per `auth.uid()`). Drift is a local cache replaced per type after pull. Writes are online-required (no offline outbox). Prefs stay on SharedPreferences. No GymBlog.API. See `07-local-data-and-integrations.mdc` and `docs/sync-strategy.md`.
